	(text "The Discharge circuit receives power from wires\ngoing directly into the precharge-discharge board\nwithout entering the motherboard first. This is\nbecause these wires cannot have a fuse. The above\ntext labels of HV_TS_+ and HV_TS_- on the pre/dis HV \nmicrofit are representative of those wires, rather\nthan any traces on the motherboard."
